    chooseUs: 'You have footage, a product or a story and need a finished film. AgentShot edits on your computer with your own model, cuts on the words, speakers, shots and beats, adds captions, music and motion graphics, films real product walkthroughs from a URL, and shows every change as a before/after version. It is free and open source, with no credit meter on the edit, and the whole cut opens in Premiere, Resolve or Final Cut when you want to keep going.',
    prompt: 'Turn this 40-minute interview into a 3-minute story, with music under it and captions.',
